<section class="manifesto">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="display m-line">A building changes every day. <em>Its record should keep up.</em></p>
    <p class="m-sub">Drawings have revisions. Software has version history. Openbox gives the site itself one: what was built, who was there and what changed, kept by date and place.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto { padding-block: clamp(120px, 18vw, 220px) clamp(72px, 10vw, 120px); }
  .m-line { font-size: clamp(40px, 6.4vw, 92px); line-height: 1; max-width: 16ch; }
  .m-line em { color: rgba(255,255,255,.46); }
  .m-sub { margin: 36px 0 0; max-width: 46ch; font-size: clamp(17px, 1.5vw, 20px); color: rgba(255,255,255,.66); text-wrap: pretty; }
</style>
